#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:46
msgid "Streaming tests"
msgstr "流式读取测试"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:48
msgid ""
"`tests/test_streaming.py` runs a local HTTP server that implements range "
"requests and counts the bytes it serves. The tests assert that an AOI read "
"moves a small fraction of the file, that pixel values equal a local read of "
"the same window, and that archives are refused. No test contacts a live "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"`tests/test_streaming.py` 运行一个实现了范围请求并统计所提供字节数的本地 HTTP 服务器。这些测试断言：读取 AOI "
"只传输文件的一小部分，像元值与对同一窗口的本地读取结果一致，并且归档文件会被拒绝。没有任何测试会连接真实的提供商。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:53
msgid "Multi-sensor regression tests"
msgstr "多传感器回归测试"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:55
msgid ""
"The multi-sensor audit added tests that fail on the earlier code and pass on"
" the fix, for example a flood scene with optical nodata, a DEM with a "
"`-9999` void, volume on a geographic grid compared with a geodesic-area "
"reference, and illumination derived independently from `unit_normal . "
"unit_sun`. Deriving the expectation independently matters: an earlier "
"terrain test inverted the pipeline's own correction with the pipeline's own "
"aspect function, so a sign error cancelled out and passed."
msgstr ""
"多传感器审计新增了一些测试，它们在早期代码上失败、在修复后通过，例如含光学 nodata 的洪水场景、带有 `-9999` 空洞的 "
"DEM、与测地面积参考值对比的地理网格上的体积，以及由 `unit_normal . unit_sun` "
"独立推导的光照。独立推导期望值很重要：早期的一个地形测试用流水线自身的坡向函数去反演流水线自身的校正，导致符号错误相互抵消而通过了测试。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:62
msgid "Writing tests"
msgstr "编写测试"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:64
msgid "Put new tests in `tests/`, named `test_<area>.py`."
msgstr "将新测试放在 `tests/` 中，命名为 `test_<area>.py`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:65
msgid ""
"Test against a real behaviour, not only that a call returns. For numerical "
"code, derive the expected value independently of the code under test."
msgstr "针对真实行为进行测试，而不仅仅是检查调用有返回。对于数值代码，请独立于被测代码推导期望值。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:66
msgid "Do not depend on network access. Use a local server or mock for HTTP."
msgstr "不要依赖网络访问。对 HTTP 使用本地服务器或 mock。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/testing.md:67
msgid ""
"Skip, rather than fail, when an optional dependency is missing: "
"`pytest.importorskip(\"rasterio\")`."
msgstr "当缺少可选依赖时，应跳过而不是失败：`pytest.importorskip(\"rasterio\")`。"
